      "description": "A slightly closer look at the PP Royal Palace Throne Room. What a grand structure that is! It's interior was quite opulent and rather ostentatious, but photography inside is prohibited. You are not allowed to enter the room either,but have to look (look only, no photography) from the entrance doorway. (Phnom Penh, Cambodia, Apr/ May 2014)",
