      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0",
      "artist": "shankar s. from Dubai, united arab emirates",
      "description": "We are approaching the Throne Room now. Note the beautiful steps leading up to it. Photography inside is prohibited, so you can only admire the ostentatious interior from the entrance doorway. Since the Royalty no longer plays a part in the administration of the country, they remain a ceremonial symbol only. This hall is now used for state receptions and other palace ceremonies. Note clips fixed to the centre of the steps where a red carpet can be laid whenever visiting dignitaries arrive.  (Phnom Penh, Cambodia, Apr/ May 2014)",
